  "NewsSummary": "To celebrate the outstanding contribution to, and leadership of, the Aga Khan University by President Shamsh Kassim-Lakha, H.I., S.I., a ceremony to honor his achievements was held on behalf of faculty, staff, students and volunteers on Thursday, Apr",
